sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GL as deploy:dev job
    participant TF as Terraform
    participant ECS as ECS service
    participant OLD as Task v1 (running)
    participant NEW as Task v2 (new image)
    participant ALB as ALB target group
    participant SM as smoke:dev / rollback:dev

    GL->>ECS: describe-services, record PREV_TASK_DEF = v1
    GL->>TF: terraform apply tfplan (image_tag = sha)
    TF->>ECS: register task definition v2 + update service
    Note over ECS: rolling update · minimumHealthyPercent 100 ·<br/>maximumPercent 200 · circuit breaker (rollback = true)
    ECS->>NEW: start task (pull ECR :sha, inject DB secret)
    NEW->>NEW: container healthcheck /api/health
    ECS->>ALB: register v2 target
    alt v2 healthy (2 × 15 s checks)
        ALB-->>ECS: healthy
        ECS->>OLD: deregister (15 s drain) → stop
        GL->>GL: wait services-stable OK · s3 sync · invalidate
        GL->>SM: APP_URL, PREV_TASK_DEF (dotenv)
        SM->>SM: smoke test 5 checks
        alt smoke passes
            Note over SM: pipeline green · rollback skipped · prod available
        else smoke fails (runs but behaves wrong)
            SM->>ECS: rollback:dev → update-service --task-definition v1
            ECS->>OLD: start v1 again, then drain v2
            Note over SM: rolled back · next green pipeline re-converges state
        end
    else v2 keeps failing health checks (crash, bad config)
        ALB-->>ECS: unhealthy
        ECS->>ECS: circuit breaker trips → roll back to v1 automatically
        Note over OLD: v1 never stopped, so zero downtime
        GL-->>GL: wait services-stable fails → job FAIL
    end
